---
import Basis from "../layouts/Basis.astro";
---

<Basis
  titel="Privacy"
  beschrijving="Privacy policy of Louie's Recipe Drive."
>
  <h1>Privacy</h1>
  <p>
    This site sets no cookies and uses no trackers that follow you as a
    person. Fonts are self-hosted, so nothing is sent to Google Fonts or any
    other third party.
  </p>
  <p>
    For visitor statistics we use (once active) a privacy-friendly service
    such as Plausible or Umami, which sets no cookies and collects no personal
    data. That is also why there is no cookie banner.
  </p>
  <p>
    If you sign up for the newsletter, your email address is only used to send
    you recipes and updates. You can unsubscribe at any time.
  </p>
</Basis>
